{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Robot finds and grabs visible objects; checks properties and does specific task; moves and scans area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectClose    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
            {
                "IsObjectClose": "Boolean"
            },
            {
                "IsObjectVisible": "Boolean"
            }
        ],
        "Node": {
            "Type": "Sequence",
            "Decorators": [],
            "Nodes": [
                {
                    "Type": "Sequence",
                    "Decorators": [
                        {
                            "IsObjectVisible?": "IsObjectVisible"
                        }
                    ],
                    "Nodes": [
                        {
                            "Type": "Task",
                            "Decorators": [],
                            "Nodes": [],
